                        Kailangan para sa lokal na trabaho, postal ID, pagbubukas ng bank account, at NBI / Police clearances.
                    </p>
                    <ul class="service-meta-list">
                        <li><i class="bi bi-check-circle-fill text-success"></i> Valid Government ID / PhilSys</li>
                        <li><i class="bi bi-check-circle-fill text-success"></i> Talampas Residency Record</li>
                        <li><i class="bi bi-clock-history text-secondary"></i> 1–2 Business Days</li>
                    </ul>
                    <div class="service-price-tag">
                        <span>₱50.00</span>
                        <a href="/register" class="btn btn-sm btn-civic-primary">
                            Apply <i class="bi bi-arrow-up-right"></i>
                        </a>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Certificate of Indigency -->
            <div class="col-lg-3 col-md-6">
                <div class="service-card">
                    <div class="service-icon-box">
                        <i class="bi bi-heart-pulse-fill"></i>
                    </div>
                    <h4 class="service-card-title">Certificate of Indigency</h4>
                    <p class="text-muted small">
                        Para sa tulong medikal sa ospital, scholarship, 4Ps educational assistance, at libreng legal aid sa PAO.
                    </p>
                    <ul class="service-meta-list">
                        <li><i class="bi bi-check-circle-fill text-success"></i> Katunayan ng kawalan ng regular kita</li>
                        <li><i class="bi bi-check-circle-fill text-success"></i> Endorsement ng Purok Leader</li>
                        <li><i class="bi bi-clock-history text-secondary"></i> Same Day o 24 Oras</li>
                    </ul>
                    <div class="service-price-tag">
                        <span class="text-success">LIBRE (₱0.00)</span>
                        <a href="/register" class="btn btn-sm btn-civic-outline">
                            Apply <i class="bi bi-arrow-up-right"></i>
                        </a>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Certificate of Residency -->
            <div class="col-lg-3 col-md-6">
                <div class="service-card">
                    <div class="service-icon-box">
                        <i class="bi bi-house-check-fill"></i>
                    </div>
                    <h4 class="service-card-title">Certificate of Residency</h4>
                    <p class="text-muted small">
                        Katunayan ng tirahan para sa Meralco, water district connection, school enrollment, o legal affidavits.
                    </p>
                    <ul class="service-meta-list">
                        <li><i class="bi bi-check-circle-fill text-success"></i> Katunayan ng tirahan sa Talampas</li>
                        <li><i class="bi bi-check-circle-fill text-success"></i> Talaan sa Household Masterlist</li>
                        <li><i class="bi bi-clock-history text-secondary"></i> 24 Oras</li>
                    </ul>
                    <div class="service-price-tag">
                        <span>₱50.00</span>
                        <a href="/register" class="btn btn-sm btn-civic-outline">
                            Apply <i class="bi bi-arrow-up-right"></i>
                        </a>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Business Clearance -->
            <div class="col-lg-3 col-md-6">
                <div class="service-card">
                    <div class="service-icon-box">
                        <i class="bi bi-shop"></i>
                    </div>
                    <h4 class="service-card-title">Barangay Business Clearance</h4>
                    <p class="text-muted small">
                        Para sa sari-sari store, negosyo, komersyal na establisyimento, at Mayor's Permit renewal sa Bustos.
                    </p>
                    <ul class="service-meta-list">
                        <li><i class="bi bi-check-circle-fill text-success"></i> DTI / SEC Registration</li>
                        <li><i class="bi bi-check-circle-fill text-success"></i> Kontrata ng Upa / Katibayan ng pwesto</li>
                        <li><i class="bi bi-clock-history text-secondary"></i> 2–3 Business Days</li>
                    </ul>
                    <div class="service-price-tag">
                        <span>₱150.00</span>
                        <a href="/register" class="btn btn-sm btn-civic-outline">
                            Apply <i class="bi bi-arrow-up-right"></i>
                        </a>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

